{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35629","headline":"谒翰林刘学士不遇 · 李山甫","name":"谒翰林刘学士不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦绕清华宴地深，洞宫横锁晓沈沈。\n鹏飞碧海终难见，鹤入青霄岂易寻。\n六尺羇魂迷定止，两行愁血谢知音。\n平生只耻凌风翼，随得鸣珂上禁林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}